# Cursor agent renders land here.
#
# This directory is declared by .cursor-plugin/plugin.json ("agents") so that
# Cursor does not fall back to folder discovery and pick up the Claude-flavored
# agents/ at the repo root. It is intentionally empty until
# dualplugin_cursor_render emits the Cursor flavor of chunk-executor and
# intent-auditor into it.
#
# Kept as .gitkeep rather than README.md on purpose: Cursor discovers agents as
# "all .md, .mdc, or .markdown files" in this directory, so a README here would
# be loaded as an agent.
#
# Chunk: docs/chunks/dualplugin_cursor_scaffold - Declared-but-empty agents dir
